    <string name="feature_settings_impl_privacy_body">Resonote stores theme and playback preferences, queue and playback/search history, and music you explicitly import on this device. Sign-in credentials use encrypted storage. Online content, sign-in, cloud music and recognition communicate with upstream services only when required by those features. Opening About checks the public GitHub Releases endpoint for updates. Recognition audio is used for the current request and cleared after completion, cancellation or failure. Resonote contains no advertising, analytics or telemetry. Playback cache only reduces repeated traffic and can be cleared at any time.</string>
